 from Node.js</a>.\nThe following defaults can be set on the Table service.\ndefaultTimeoutIntervalInMs                          The default timeout interval, in milliseconds, to use for request made via the Table service.\ndefaultClientRequestTimeoutInMs                     The default timeout of client requests, in milliseconds, to use for the request made via the Table service.\ndefaultMaximumExecutionTimeInMs                     The default maximum execution time across all potential retries, for requests made via the Table service.\ndefaultLocationMode                                 The default location mode for requests made via the Table service.\ndefaultPayloadFormat                                The default payload format for requests made via the Table service.\nuseNagleAlgorithm                                   Determines whether the Nagle algorithm is used for requests made via the Table service.; true to use the<br>                                                    Nagle algorithm; otherwise, false. The default value is false.</p>\n","type":"Class","syntax":null,"platform":null}],"description":"<p sourcefile=\"out/BatchResult.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\" sourceendlinenumber=\"1\">The table service.</p>\n","optional":false},{"id":"table","type":[{"uid":"string","specName":[{"lang":"js","value":"<xref uid=\"string\" displayProperty=\"name\" altProperty=\"fullName\"/>"}]}],"description":"<p sourcefile=\"out/BatchResult.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\" sourceendlinenumber=\"1\">The table name.</p>\n","optional":false},{"id":"operations","type":[{"uid":"array","specName":[{"lang":"js","value":"<xref uid=\"array\" displayProperty=\"name\" altProperty=\"fullName\"/>"}]}],"description":"<p sourcefile=\"out/BatchResult.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\" sourceendlinenumber=\"1\">The array of batch operations.</p>\n","optional":false}]},"_enableSearch":true,"_docfxVersion":"1.0.0.0"},{"uid":"BatchResult#constructWebResource","parent":[{"lang":"js","value